scripts\case-law-information-extraction\output\v1-backup\rules.csv:2140:draftly-rule-courts-sc-sc_fr_15_2010.pdf-1,courts-sc-sc_fr_15_2010.pdf,,SC,2010,The minister must hold an inquiry as he thinks fit before making a decision to forfeit property.,It is a further requirement that the minister should hold such inquiry as he thinks fit before the decision is made.,SRC001-s2,ok-unchecked,verbatim,ratio,high,llm-extract,unverified
